{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_b55e5501153e458eaa483db18fc0ed20","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_36c34769412bbc0fed30a69dfaa7fedeb057783af4401c71a9204f7cd1641014","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"rivet-dev/sandbox-agent@bbc195cc3fb5 snapshot 56989d83a6914f57","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_335402324756967e4704d6d93c8a4dd25971bd5e71287736e44d5bcd20c57693"],"source_ids":["src_e63aeda93bd55f609ba948651e015917"],"text":"Repository development practice: CLAUDE.md instructs contributors to keep CLI subcommands and HTTP endpoints in sync, update docs/cli.mdx on CLI changes, and regenerate docs/openapi.json when HTTP contracts change.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b55e5501153e458eaa483db18fc0ed20"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_b55e5501153e458eaa483db18fc0ed20","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_3b99eb62e5f03b235d5b8f0a137a788a2fc0444bb7b473a4c6f7336adaee8f05","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"rivet-dev/sandbox-agent@bbc195cc3fb5 snapshot 56989d83a6914f57","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0aab4515508009dd5e32d3d45d246aa4a1e53d4aa52d9c61999cadb1e4a0c2ae","slc_18e26d42ecf8adf9c56ec6011fcabc3df091ee161d4dc568cbed138cb2efe817","slc_6eb9b225d8e0d31b4d1ec291181c6bc7546e0712c1f6ab49c932d5062e4ece74","slc_8c589b7855ad1fcee2cfd3e4f972326761cbcafa42aaa37743cda98ebeb14cd2","slc_a3bb54e1700104eb1e748675e22edcea8505175ba05427f887a9bc0afa339e9e","slc_edb98369b14ea389018325fd7dd5ff703bc81cdcb37d8cfbc3a1afd2f1c86ff8"],"source_ids":["src_d2070ba8873159f2bba6a794213032c0"],"text":"The TypeScript SDK supports embedded mode via SandboxAgent.start() and remote server mode via SandboxAgent.connect() with a baseUrl and token, and offers methods like listAgents, createSession, postMessage, and streamEvents.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b55e5501153e458eaa483db18fc0ed20"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_b55e5501153e458eaa483db18fc0ed20","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5699c7bdc6e84a2368dff746f65401fe9b415f28da3374d59a37474bf3293576","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"rivet-dev/sandbox-agent@bbc195cc3fb5 snapshot 56989d83a6914f57","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_a650cecde481fef48d59fce1819e115c7aa8bfe8e981eb1227f7503f7750de6e","slc_d4f37c66fc7add173354548339ecc40bf7d35859dd82f06a14c2b4b3bd32fc7c"],"source_ids":["src_d2070ba8873159f2bba6a794213032c0"],"text":"The server is implemented as a single static Rust binary, chosen for fast startup and predictable memory usage so it can run in sandboxes or CI without a Node.js runtime.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b55e5501153e458eaa483db18fc0ed20"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_b55e5501153e458eaa483db18fc0ed20","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_78cd62e388ca61b9205ba5caa1357221fd1591520093c04db81b49dab1015226","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"rivet-dev/sandbox-agent@bbc195cc3fb5 snapshot 56989d83a6914f57","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1079e34d05ad74369715e5a58398e94cdd52bd65ff3663958da566fead761e76","slc_24dc2fbea8fc438fe0398319ce2e9ef27c927bef99677d596aeb08e997de9351"],"source_ids":["src_d2070ba8873159f2bba6a794213032c0"],"text":"The SDK does not persist session data itself; events stream in a universal JSON schema that consumers are expected to store externally, e.g. in Postgres, ClickHouse, or Rivet.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b55e5501153e458eaa483db18fc0ed20"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_b55e5501153e458eaa483db18fc0ed20","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_941e2d550bd396066cd667c7725808f6aedd6502c061458f50d88467876322b8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"rivet-dev/sandbox-agent@bbc195cc3fb5 snapshot 56989d83a6914f57","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_07eb18b908ec41d5aa8c72055591bb77e319776bbc314085707afcf752f37c20","slc_3378e56a98c8c15a97091b6b4f38bd5d2e3cc38fb9fa5b9ebdd026057849014c"],"source_ids":["src_d2070ba8873159f2bba6a794213032c0"],"text":"Agent binaries are installed lazily on first use by default, with an optional 'sandbox-agent install-agent --all' command to preinstall them.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b55e5501153e458eaa483db18fc0ed20"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_b55e5501153e458eaa483db18fc0ed20","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a9e4a25e4a74a1fa96bc095f1a7408e6a1dc215e99ebffb61a659b79bd0eb7af","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"rivet-dev/sandbox-agent@bbc195cc3fb5 snapshot 56989d83a6914f57","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6dbfd130431e2046c8fe99362fe37b21fce1560c72909235b772940f13305867","slc_81e525b2e3583b4c1d7e10eedf231bb432bfb8a99d4eab856f6e3178ada5fb25","slc_e688ef804be1d2eda23fc72b40c11b764bc0416facacaa23ed8e1f9e12d84da0"],"source_ids":["src_d2070ba8873159f2bba6a794213032c0"],"text":"The server is started with a token for auth (e.g. 'sandbox-agent server --token ... --host 127.0.0.1 --port 2468'), and a --no-token flag exists to disable auth locally.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b55e5501153e458eaa483db18fc0ed20"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:10Z","created_by_operation":"op_b55e5501153e458eaa483db18fc0ed20","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_bd54df6b2cc9905d7aa78b3796af6cc63e894512520caad0bb1888cfa90fd357","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"rivet-dev/sandbox-agent@bbc195cc3fb5 snapshot 56989d83a6914f57","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_0d46a95bd7319d854d4b3d0da329586bef700d5c494bd9379ba6fc4aaf8ee49e"],"source_ids":["src_d2070ba8873159f2bba6a794213032c0"],"text":"The project comprises a Rust daemon ('sandbox-agent server') exposing HTTP+SSE, a TypeScript SDK with embedded and server modes, a built-in Inspector UI, and a CLI mirroring the HTTP endpoints.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:10Z","updated_by_operation":"op_b55e5501153e458eaa483db18fc0ed20"}
